 "text": "Skip to main content\nHome - Zeus Auction\n-->\n-->\nSkip to main content\nToggle Navigation\nhome\nwhy register?\nlearn more\ntax sales\nfaqs\nsupport\nhelp\ncreate account\nlogin\nlogin\nusername or email\npassword\nlogin\nForgot your password?\nForgot your username?\nNew user?\nRegister Now!\nEnglish\nEspañol\nFrançais\nMeet Zeus\nYour government auction solution.\nThe Zeus Auction Program incorporates the latest technology and over 20 years of experience to make bidding in auctions easy. Manage your account, view live statistics, and place single or multiple bids from one place.\nsearch properties\nlogin\ncreate account\nWant to start bidding?\nIt's easy!\nCreate an account\n1. Create an account\nGetting started is easy, just fill out a quick form and you're on your way.\nRegister for an auction\n2. Select an auction\nBrowse upcoming and live auctions, choose one, apply, and participate.\nView listings\n3. View listings\nAfter approval, add items to your Watchlist for quick and easy bidding.\nBid\n4. Bid\nReceive immediate on screen alerts after placing bids.\nView results\n5. View results\nAccess auction results from your Dashboard or email after the auction ends.\n×\nRedirect\nBy clicking below you will be transferred to the SRI sale search site. This site allows you to search all properties for sale without a login. For online auctions you must register and/or login to Zeus below.\ncontinue\ncancel\nhome\nlogin\nregister\nwhy register?\nlearn more\nsupport\nhelp\nstay connected!\nPrivacy Policy |\nTerms of Use\n-->\nVersion 2026-10-16T13:25:23-07:00",
